// Own niri customizations, shared through the dotfiles (group niri, like the zsh config).
// The files are symlinks into the repository: edit them here or there, commit, and every
// host with the feature niri gets them with the next machine update. niri reloads its
// config on save.
//
// ~/.config/niri/config.kdl (written by DMS) includes this file last with
// `include optional=true "dotfiles.kdl"`, so everything here wins over DMS's settings.
// Leave config.kdl and dms/*.kdl to DMS.
//
// One file per topic under dotfiles/, included below; later files win over earlier ones.
// For a new topic add the file and an include line, for example:
//   dotfiles/layout.kdl  gaps, borders, column widths
//   dotfiles/rules.kdl   window rules
//   dotfiles/look.kdl    animations, shadows, colors

include "dotfiles/binds.kdl"
